{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜〜〜〜〜！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大日本アカン警察の収録をしてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見て下さいW(`0`)W"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家のお風呂の水道がまた反抗期です..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついこないだは6度目くらいの水風呂を作られ、昨日は100℃ですかこれというほど熱すぎる熱湯風呂を作られました。右足が悲鳴をあげました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生は悲しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出会ったばかりの頃はあんなに素直やったのに..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/07/19/3830941/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピースW(`0`)W"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジブリ作品「風立ちぬ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ観に行きたい！映画館で流れた4分間の予告映像で感動しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも乃木坂浪漫でやったことがある作品！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「私、なんだか急に生きたくなったのね...、あなたのおかげで...。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というセリフが印象に残ってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の夢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"殺陣を習った！刀振り回してました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから母校の小学校に行ったんですが懐かしかったです。夢仕様やから本物とは違うけど、雰囲気は一緒で、行きたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/07/19/3830941/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"孔雀と白孔雀と..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","t